{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_wishlist.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Townseek is a cosy exploration-trading adventure where you soar through the skies of Explora in search of Sir Reginald Sharkingston\u2019s lost legacy! Discover exotic landmarks, trade with whimsical townsfolk, fish, collect artefacts, and uncover the secrets of a vibrant world. The sky is your sea, so set sail and see it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_introduction.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A PICTURESQUE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully hand-drawn world at your own pace. Uncover lush forests, freezing icebergs, vast deserts, fiery volcanoes and more across the vibrant land of Explora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_exploration_banner.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRADE WITH UNIQUE TOWNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet charming town hosts and trade for rare items and profit. Complete quests to build your reputation, unlock upgrades, and earn cosmetics. Discover the diverse cultures of sharkfolk, cats, slimes, stonelings, humans and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_trading_banner.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE IT YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is so much to do across Explora. Take a break from trading to customise your airship with new blimps and hulls. Go fishing for curious catches, mine for rare artefacts, dig up treasure or grow exotic fruits. It is your journey, so shape it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_fishing_banner.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPLETE YOUR JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the journal bestowed upon you by Captain Jawline and uncover the lost legacy of Sir Reginald Sharkingston. Fill its pages with memories, complete your item collection and create an unforgettable adventure of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_collection_banner.gif?t=1752532429\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1659360?t=1752532429","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752532429","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752532429","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752532429","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"d